# Module 4 Lab Session 3: Exercise 5: The Enrollment API (Controllers with Real CRUD)

### 1. GET all enrollments (empty list)
GET {{TmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments
Accept: application/json

###

### 2. POST a new enrollment
POST {{TmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "S-001",
  "courseCode": "CS-101"
}

###

### 3. GET created enrollment
# Replace the ID after POST response
GET {{TmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments/0acba511
Accept: application/json

###

### 4. DELETE the enrollment
# Replace the ID after POST response
DELETE {{TmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments/0acba511

###

### 5. GET deleted enrollment
# Replace the ID after DELETE
GET {{TmsApi_HostAddress}}/api/enrollments/0acba511
Accept: application/json

